					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1152" height="946" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO City 60506 Classic Beach Streetcar June 2026 Front Box" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box.png 1152w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-300x246.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-1024x841.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-768x631.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1152px) 100vw, 1152px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Happy Friday Evening LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders</p>
