		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114275</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1230" height="615" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Every-LEGO-Retiring-Soon-Sets-List-November-2026-featured-scaled-e1794001071177.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Every LEGO Retiring Soon Sets List (November 2026) featured" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>With November here and the holiday season quickly approaching, LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia) has updated</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/every-lego-retiring-soon-sets-list-november-2026-over-200-items/">Every LEGO Retiring Soon Sets List (November 2026): Over 200 Items</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>With November here and the holiday season quickly approaching, LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) has updated its list of sets that are retiring soon. Currently, the list sits at around 200, and there are popular sets from a variety of themes that are on their way out.</p>
<p>Read on to see a comprehensive list of all LEGO sets that are retiring soon, broken down by theme so you can quickly jump to your favorite.</p>
<p>*List is based on LEGO US. Other regions like UK and Australia may have slightly different items retiring soon.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92071 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10335-The-Endurance-November-2024-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1110" height="870" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10335-The-Endurance-November-2024-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1110w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10335-The-Endurance-November-2024-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x235.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10335-The-Endurance-November-2024-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x803.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10335-The-Endurance-November-2024-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x602.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1110px) 100vw, 1110px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks as we regularly update and inform all of our readers of the latest LEGO Retiring Soon sets and products.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
