					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1817" height="671" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND Deutschland Theme Park Resort Germany Holiday Winter Features &amp; Attractions 2026 Christmas Ice Skating Rink, Curling Rinks, Miniland, LEGOLAND Express Train" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train.jpg 1817w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-300x111.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-1024x378.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-768x284.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-1536x567.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1817px) 100vw, 1817px" /></p>
<p>The November 2026 deals and offers are here for LEGOLAND Europe (United Kingdom, Denmark and Germany). Whether you&#8217;re looking</p>
