										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114400 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Billund-Denmark-The-Temple-Ride-Attraction-Feature-Banner-Logo-Theme-Park.jpg" alt="" width="1451" height="561" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Billund-Denmark-The-Temple-Ride-Attraction-Feature-Banner-Logo-Theme-Park.jpg 1451w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Billund-Denmark-The-Temple-Ride-Attraction-Feature-Banner-Logo-Theme-Park-300x116.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Billund-Denmark-The-Temple-Ride-Attraction-Feature-Banner-Logo-Theme-Park-1024x396.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Billund-Denmark-The-Temple-Ride-Attraction-Feature-Banner-Logo-Theme-Park-768x297.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1451px) 100vw, 1451px" /></p>
<p>The November 2026 deals and offers are here for LEGOLAND Europe (<a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">United Kingdom</a>, <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Denmark</a> and <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Germany</a>). Whether you&#8217;re looking for discounted tickets, hotels, annual passes, or packages, we&#8217;ve got you covered. Let&#8217;s take a closer look at ways to save on your next adventure.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114402 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train.jpg" alt="" width="1439" height="531" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train.jpg 1817w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-300x111.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-1024x378.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-768x284.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Deutschland-Theme-Park-Resort-Germany-Holiday-Winter-Features-Attractions-2026-Christmas-Ice-Skating-Rink-Curling-Rinks-Miniland-LEGOLAND-Express-Train-1536x567.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1439px) 100vw, 1439px" /></p>
<h2>LEGOLAND Windsor Resort (UK)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Book in advance and save on your tickets. Tickets online from £32, compared to the standard £68.</li>
<li>Take part in the Ultimate Day Out with one-day entry + golf from £36, compared to the walk-up price of £78.</li>
<li>Experience the Ultimate LEGO Sleepover, which includes an overnight stay, one-day park entry, and breakfast, starting at £91.</li>
<li>Enjoy a Christmas break with hotels from £85pp. Available on select dates from November 20th, 2026 to January 2nd, 2027.</li>
<li>Take a well-earned midweek break, with hotels from £91pp.</li>
<li>Spend your February Half Term at LEGOLAND, with hotels from £105pp.</li>
<li>Plan your 2027 short break early, with hotels from £100pp.</li>
<li>If you already have tickets, you can add a night&#8217;s stay to your trip, with hotels from £60pp.</li>
<li>Merlin Annual Passholders can enjoy an overnight stay for less, with up to 15% savings on a LEGO-themed sleepover. Hotels from £44pp.</li>
<li>Enjoy a fun-fueled toddler break, with hotels starting at £91pp.</li>
<li>Stay &amp; Play deals where you can bring the fun indoors and enjoy several benefits on days when the Theme Park is closed. Starting at £155 per family.</li>
<li>Book for two nights or more and get a 20% discount on your Bed &amp; Breakfast, with hotels from £103pp,</li>
