<h2>LEGOLAND Billund Resort (Denmark)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Get an Early Bird Christmas Ticket for 239 DKK, compared to 519 DKK at the entrance, and be able to visit LEGOLAND on any opening day during Christmas (November 28th to December 31st). Offer available until November 18th.</li>
<li>Purchase a 2-day ticket online for 368 DKK, compared to 688 DKK at the entrance. Use your second visit within 6 days of your first.</li>
<li>Enjoy the full LEGO experience with a Combi ticket that gives you access to LEGOLAND and LEGO House for 649 DKK if you buy it online, compared to 878 DKK if you buy them both separately. You can visit LEGOLAND up to 6 days before or after visiting LEGO House.</li>
<li>Experience a short break or holiday with the family, starting at 600 DKK per person.</li>
<li>Take part in a magical Christmas getaway for 742 DKK per person. Comes with two day tickets and one overnight stay, and you can book your getaway for between November 28th and December 30th.</li>
<li>Treat yourself to the Ultimate LEGO Destination that gives you entrance tickets, tickets to LEGO House, and a 1-night overnight stay for 750 DKK per person.</li>
<li>Celebrate the new year at LEGOLAND with a 1-day ticket for December 31st, a 1-night stay from December 31st to January 1st, access to the New Year&#8217;s Eve party, a 3-course buffet and drinks, and breakfast, for 1,999 DKK per person.</li>
<li>Indulge in a VIP DreamStay, which gives you 1 overnight stay, complete with free choice of room, early check-in and check-out, in-room welcome treats, dinner, snacks, and breakfast, starting from 7,300 DKK per person.</li>
