<li>Get your winter ticket at an early-bird price of EUR 22 per person, compared to the regular price of EUR 35 per person. Redeemable on a day of your choice during the winter opening 2026/27, with the early-bird offer only bookable until November 15th, 2026.</li>
<li>Enjoy an overnight stay at WinterWonder LEGOLAND, which also includes 2 days&#8217; park admission per person, starting at EUR 104 per person.</li>
