					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1352" height="1435" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Six LEGO Botanical Mini Flower January 2027 Sets Revealed (11537 11536 11535 11534 11533 11532) Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box.jpg 1352w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-283x300.jpg 283w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-965x1024.jpg 965w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-768x815.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-1024x1087.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1352px) 100vw, 1352px" /></p>
<p>Six LEGO Botanical Mini Flower January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). There are 6 different flowers</p>
