										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Six LEGO Botanical Mini Flower January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). There are 6 different flowers you can collect and the price for these mini sets are quite reasonable! Release Dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more would be looked at for all these little cute flower sets.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114389 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="923" height="980" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box.jpg 1352w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-283x300.jpg 283w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-965x1024.jpg 965w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-768x815.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Six-LEGO-Botanical-Mini-Flower-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-11537-11536-11535-11534-11533-11532-Front-Box-1024x1087.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 923px) 100vw, 923px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when these mini LEGO Botanical flower plant sets becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<ul>
<li>11537 Chicory Flowers</li>
<li>11536 Nasturtium Flowers</li>
<li>11535 Sweet Pea Flowers</li>
<li>11534 Bluebell Flowers</li>
<li>11533 Malva Flowers</li>
<li>11532 Buttercup Flowers</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
