										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114318 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>A brand-new LEGO Spring Festival Lunar New Year January 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Release Dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more would be looked at for 80123 Spring Festival Voyage.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when 80123 Spring Festival Voyage becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<ul>
<li> 80123 Spring Festival Voyage January 2027</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114330 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-6.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-6.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-6-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-6-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-6-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114331 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-7.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-7.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-7-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-7-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-80123-Spring-Festival-Voyage-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-7-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h3>LEGO 80123 Spring Festival Voyage January 2027 Set Revealed: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Set Images Info</h3>
<h3>80123 Spring Festival Voyage January 2027</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $119.99 USD / $159.99 CAD / £89.99 GBP / $149.99 AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 9+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 1529</li>
<li>Official Release Date: January 1, 2027 (Pre-Orders Now Accepted at LEGO US, Canada and UK)</li>
