					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Botanical 11522 Perfectly Pastel Flower Bouquet February 2027 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Botanical-11522-Perfectly-Pastel-Flower-Bouquet-February-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>A brand-new LEGO Botanical Plant Flower February 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). Release Dates, US/Canada prices,</p>
