										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Two all-new LEGO Spring Festival (Lunar New Year) January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Release Dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more would be looked at for 80122 Auspicious Pixiu Under Fortune Tree and 40976 Prosperity Lion.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114241 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-80122-Auspicious-Pixiu-Under-Fortune-Tree-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-80122-Auspicious-Pixiu-Under-Fortune-Tree-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-80122-Auspicious-Pixiu-Under-Fortune-Tree-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-80122-Auspicious-Pixiu-Under-Fortune-Tree-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-80122-Auspicious-Pixiu-Under-Fortune-Tree-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114230 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-40976-Prosperity-Lion-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-3.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-40976-Prosperity-Lion-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-3.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-40976-Prosperity-Lion-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-40976-Prosperity-Lion-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Spring-Festival-40976-Prosperity-Lion-January-2027-Release-Date-Lunar-New-Year-Lifestyle-3-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
